<title>ITALY: Italy net inflow of EU credits 3.8 trln lire in Q1.</title>
<headline>Italy net inflow of EU credits 3.8 trln lire in Q1.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy received a net financial inflow of credits from the European Union of 3.862 trillion lire in the first quarter of 1997, according to a quarterly study by the Italian state auditor.</p>
<p>Italy's payments to the EU in the period totalled 6.663 trillion lire and financial payments received by Italy equalled 10.525 trillion, the study said.</p>
<p>Credits from the EU in the same period in 1996 were 6.314 trillion.</p>
<p>((-- Rome bureau +392 66129507))</p>
